@startuml
title US-09 DFD: Login with TU Account
left to right direction
skinparam roundcorner 12

rectangle "User" as User
rectangle "TU REST API" as TUAPI
usecase "9.1\nValidate Input\nFormat" as P1
usecase "9.2\nCheck Cache &\nIP Rate Limit" as P2
usecase "9.3\nVerify with\nTU REST API" as P3
usecase "9.4\nUpsert Profile &\nIssue JWT" as P4
database "D6: RAM Cache & Limit" as D6
database "D1: Users" as D1

User --> P1 : username, password
P1 --> P2 : Valid format (400 if bad)
P2 <--> D6 : Lookup HMAC cache / IP window
P2 --> P3 : Cache miss & under limit
P2 --> P4 : Cache hit
P3 --> TUAPI : POST /auth/Ad/verify
TUAPI --> P3 : Status & TU profile
P3 --> D6 : Store 5m TTL cache
P3 --> P4 : Active profile & role
P4 <--> D1 : Upsert user (no passwordHash)
P4 --> User : JWT + user profile / 401 / 403 / 429
@enduml
